{"unit_id":"reisen-ww__dsh-bonk-pet#card-zh","repo":"reisen-ww/dsh-bonk-pet","commit":"e8b7b762efcc43adcb63b487016cc31b08734be5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"敲盆宠物是 DSH Web 界面的互动鲸鱼小组件。它将悬浮宠物挂在页面中，并通过宿主事件流响应任务状态和错误。用户可以敲击铁盆、拖动鲸鱼、调整音乐与音效音量，也可替换图片和音频素材。宠物会在工作时唱歌，遇到错误时显示反应，饥饿时寻找白饭。适合希望为 DSH 网页界面添加轻松反馈与可定制宠物的用户；不需要 API 密钥，可选素材放在 DSH_HOME/bonk-pet 目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:511-572","lib/client.js:1866-1897"]}
{"unit_id":"reisen-ww__dsh-bonk-pet#card-en","repo":"reisen-ww/dsh-bonk-pet","commit":"e8b7b762efcc43adcb63b487016cc31b08734be5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Bonk Pet adds a floating whale to DSH Web that reacts to task status and errors. Users can knock or drag it, adjust music and sound effects, and replace its artwork or audio. It sings while an agent works and seeks food when hungry. No API key is needed; optional assets go in DSH_HOME/bonk-pet.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:511-572","lib/client.js:1866-1897"]}
